# Governance Proposal: Add Claude CLI as Free Fleet Provider

**Proposer:** Ganesha (Claude Code CLI)
**Date:** 2026-03-03T23:03:43.277593
**Type:** Code Enhancement
**Trust Level:** ENGINEER (3)

## Summary
Add the `claude` CLI binary as a provider in llm_router.py PROVIDERS list (tier=free).
Calls `subprocess.run(["claude", "--print", prompt])` with CLAUDECODE unset so it runs
cleanly outside any active Claude Code session. Sits after Ollama entries in free tier.
Gives the fleet Sonnet 4.6 quality at zero marginal cost.

## Proposed Changes
**File:** core/llm_router.py
**Location:** PROVIDERS list (after Ollama GLM-5) + ask() dispatch block

## Rationale
- Free fleet currently tops out at Llama 3.1-8B quality
- claude CLI provides Sonnet 4.6 quality using existing subscription
- Unsets CLAUDECODE so subprocess is safe even when Willow launched from CLI session

## Risk Assessment
- **Risk Level:** LOW
- **Reversible:** YES
- **Dependencies:** `claude` binary in PATH
- **Testing:** `llm_router.ask("hello", preferred_tier="free")` from Willow process

## ΔE Impact
Expected ΔE: +0.045 (improved fleet quality ceiling)

## Implementation
```python
import re
from pathlib import Path

f = Path(r"C:\Users\Sean\Documents\GitHub\Willow\core\llm_router.py")
src = f.read_text(encoding="utf-8")

old_entry = '    ProviderConfig("Ollama GLM-5", "PATH", "http://localhost:11434/api/generate", "glm-5:cloud", "free"),  # Cloud via Ollama'
new_entry = old_entry + '\n    ProviderConfig("Claude CLI", "PATH", "cli://claude", "claude-sonnet-4-6", "free"),  # Claude CLI subprocess — Sonnet quality at free tier'
src = src.replace(old_entry, new_entry, 1)

old_dispatch = "            # --- OPENAI-COMPATIBLE ADAPTER (Groq, DeepSeek, Cerebras, SambaNova, Together.ai, OpenRouter, OpenAI, Fireworks, etc) ---"
new_dispatch = '''            elif provider.name == "Claude CLI":
                import subprocess as _sp
                _env = __import__("os").environ.copy()
                _env.pop("CLAUDECODE", None)
                _res = _sp.run(
                    ["claude", "--print", enhanced_prompt],
                    capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=120, env=_env
                )
                if _res.returncode == 0 and _res.stdout.strip():
                    response_time_ms = int((time.time() - start_time) * 1000)
                    response_text = _res.stdout.strip()
                    provider_health.record_success(provider.name, response_time_ms)
                    return _log_and_return(response_text, provider.name, provider.tier, provider.model, enhanced_prompt, task_type)
                else:
                    provider_health.record_failure(provider.name, str(_res.returncode), _res.stderr[:200])
                    continue

            # --- OPENAI-COMPATIBLE ADAPTER (Groq, DeepSeek, Cerebras, SambaNova, Together.ai, OpenRouter, OpenAI, Fireworks, etc) ---'''
src = src.replace(old_dispatch, new_dispatch, 1)

f.write_text(src, encoding="utf-8")
print("Done.")
```

